 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Most won't keep a table reserved, but some big chains do keep small reservations for a few minutes. That usually works too. Explain your situation and most places will find you a table. Some restaurants charge a cancellation fee, often if you cancel within a certain window. Check their cancellation policy before booking. Lots of people don't. The key is to be friendly and polite when canceling, so they remember you nicely.",
